Create React Project

Method 1: Using Vite (modern and commonly used)

Step 1: Create a React project.
npm create vite@latest my-app -- --template react

Step 2: Go inside the project.
cd my-app

Step 3: Install dependencies.
npm install

Step 4: Start the development server.
npm run dev



Method 2: Install React in an existing project
npm install react react-dom
Then import React functionality and create a root to render the application.



Method 3: Using CDN
For simple demonstrations, React can be added through CDN script links, without installing packages through npm.



Tips: Vite is best to use.